1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:03,872
Before you pay a supplier, three documents should agree.

2
00:00:03,992 --> 00:00:10,511
Our founder, Muhammad Imran, has 20+ years in finance and business management.

3
00:00:10,631 --> 00:00:16,040
It's called a three-way match.

4
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:19,010
The order says 100 units.

5
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:21,537
The store received 90.

6
00:00:21,657 --> 00:00:24,195
But the invoice bills 100.

7
00:00:24,315 --> 00:00:27,426
Pay for 90, or ask for a credit note.

8
00:00:27,546 --> 00:00:34,120
Oracle and many ERPs can hold an invoice until all three agree.

9
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:38,627
Want it set up to catch this? Send us a WhatsApp.
